# ── Agora (voice/video calls — POST /agora/rtc-token, POST /calls) ────────
# Sign up at https://console.agora.io, create a project, and copy its App ID
# + App Certificate (Console > Project Management > your project > Edit,
# enable "App Certificate" if it isn't already). Both are REQUIRED — until
# real values are set, /agora/rtc-token (and therefore /calls) returns a
# clear 503 "Agora not configured" instead of crashing.
AGORA_APP_ID=982779d790d64fcd8144f3437963b24b
AGORA_APP_CERTIFICATE=ae0f63a70a2243dba2b1d44eac17e72d
